Main path: order list → select order → select car → assign driver → confirm → trip scheduled. Five steps, drawn in ten minutes.

Branches missing from mockups:
no available cars → need an answer for "when does the nearest one become free," otherwise the dispatcher switches to a spreadsheet and never comes back;
driver lacks category → block, but must show who fits;
another dispatcher claimed the order while this one was thinking → need to inform before confirmation, not after.

The third branch happened twice a week and was the primary cause of distrust in the system.
